    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your glorious sound permits no other noise to be heard.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Rock-out class feature.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You and all allies within 30 feet of you reduce sonic damage by the minimum damage of your rock-out class feature if you have used your rock-out or solo class feature within the last 3 rounds.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/gonzo-feats#toc21\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
